ds in chaos","link":"https://www.liverpool.com/liverpool-fc-news/features/breaking-ifeanyi-ndukwe-levante-goal-34755565","pubDate":"2026-10-12T21:14:05+00:00","contentSnippet":"Ifeanyi Ndukwe gave a goal away in a chaotic La Liga game between Levante and Sevilla only for the young Liverpool center-back to score a dramatic equalizer deep into stoppage time","thumbnail":"https://i2-prod.liverpoolecho.co.uk/incoming/article34755577.ece/ALTERNATES/s615/0_GettyImages-2299870005.jpg","source":"liverpoolcom","language":"en","category":"general","relevanceScore":6.51051086540656,"author":"$undefined","heroImage":"https://i2-prod.liverpoolecho.co.uk/incoming/article34755577.ece/ALTERNATES/s615/0_GettyImages-2299870005.jpg","wordCount":"$undefined","tags":[]},{"title":"Piers Morgan reignites Jamie Carragher row with brutal comment on live TV - 'Big baby'","link":"https://www.mirror.co.uk/sport/football/news/piers-morgan-jamie-carragher-ronaldo-37764831","pubDate":"2026-10-12T21:02:27+00:00","contentSnippet":"Piers Morgan and Jamie Carragher were embroiled in a bitter spat on social media last week over Cristiano Ronaldo and the broadcaster has now fired another dig at the Liverpool icon","thumbnail":"https://i2-prod.irishstar.com/sport/college-baseball/article37720810.ece/ALTERNATES/s615/0_Piers-Morgan-on-Uncensored.jpg","source":"mirror","language":"en","category":"general","relevanceScore":4.7094008656999,"author":"$undefined","heroImage":"https://i2-prod.irishstar.com/sport/college-baseball/article37720810.ece/ALTERNATES/s615/0_Piers-Morgan-on-Uncensored.jpg","wordCount":"$undefined","tags":[]},{"title":"Opinion: Why Julian Ward's appointment was Liverpool most important decision","link":"https://www.anfieldwatch.co.uk/liverpool-fc/news/why-julian-wards-appointment-was-liverpool-most-important-decision","pubDate":"2026-10-12T21:00:00+00:00","contentSnippet":"Julian Ward has begun his second stint as Liverpool's sporting director, and his job isn't easy.","thumbnail":"https